# Session start — read AGENTS.md first

Before coding, searching, committing, provisioning cloud, or answering:
**read the repo-root `AGENTS.md`**. That file is the single source of truth
for agents.

Then confirm **`.cursor/rules/no-paid-cloud.mdc`**: never auto-select a paid
cloud SKU. Always Free / $0 only; **ask the owner in this session** before
any invoiceable VM, disk, IP, NAT, database, paid API, or claimer.

- `CLAUDE.md` is a stub (`@AGENTS.md`) plus Claude-only notes. Do not treat it
  as a second policy.
- `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` are either thin pointers to `AGENTS.md`, generated
  copies of hub shared rules, or product-only ops. They must not disagree
  with `AGENTS.md`.

Do not start work first and read the rules later.
